<title>FRANCE: Sita 1st half net attrib up,sees yr rise.</title>
<headline>Sita 1st half net attrib up,sees yr rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   131.4  vs	   113.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 295.5  vs	     280</p>
<p>    Turnover				     4,453  vs	   3,751</p>
<p>    Tax					     92.1  vs	    87.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Sita said in a staement said it expected turnover to rise 15 percent in 1996 and &quot;a comparable rise in the net result&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
